# Copy this to .dev.vars for local Docker dev.
# API_BASE_URL must be absolute and name the backend's compose service, so workerd (the
# SSR server) reaches it container-to-container. This is the SSR path only -- the browser
# goes through the dev server's /api proxy instead (vite.config.ts), which is why that one
# is relative and this one cannot be.
API_BASE_URL=http://api:8000
# Optional: SSR (server-side) Sentry DSN for the Worker. Leave unset locally to disable.
# In prod this is the SENTRY_DSN var in wrangler.jsonc (or a CF dashboard Worker var).
# SENTRY_DSN=
